#, no-wrap
msgid "How to use the Sampler primitive with the IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API."
msgstr "כיצד להשתמש ב-primitive של Sampler עם REST API של IBM Quantum Compute Service."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sampler with the REST API"
msgstr "Sampler עם REST API"

